    "identifier": "earth-release-earth-spine-grudge",
    "description": "<p>You generate Shards of earth and levitate them around yourself, creating a field of stone debris to protect you. For the duration of this jutsu, ranged attacks are made as if you are under half cover, with the floating earth around you.</p>\n<p>Also, creatures of your choice treat all spaces within 10 feet of you as difficult terrain. This floating earth counts as a single Earthen Artifact while active.</p>",
